## Table view
An non-editable preview of 2D lists with a lazy loading, so a really large tables can be loaded

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Table view
An non-editable preview of 2D lists with a lazy loading, so a really large tables can be loaded

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Table[RandomReal[], {i,10000}, {j,5}] // TableView

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*VB[*)(FrontEndRef["Fe56feb06-55a9-4660-89a5-3759ec7ad98f"])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAoZgESHvk5KRCeEJBwK8rPK3HNS3GtSE0uLUlMykkNVgUJp5qapaUmGZjpmpomWuqamJkZ6FpYJprqGpubWqYmmyemWFqkAQCYaRXb"*)(*]VB*)

